    ["<P_Heart>（又拍了拍你的肩膀）</>朋友，金秋湖归我罩，遇到事别忘了我！"] = "<P_Heart>(Pats your shoulder again)</> Friend, Golden Autumn Lake is under my protection. Don't forget me if you run into trouble!",
